{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00395","headline":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 肃和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠哉广覆，大矣曲成。\n九玄着象，七曜贞明。\n珪璧是奠，酝酎斯盈。\n作乐崇德，爰畅咸英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}